  "published": "2026-03-29T10:56:26.33Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Added ConnectionHub telemetry and runtime hooks: configurable shard count, anonymous queue depth, and capacity events for better observability.\n- Improved PacketDispatchChannel diagnostics, reporting dispatch loop counts, semaphore health, and middleware instrumentation.\n- Hardened UDP listener authentication with timestamp validation, poly1305 MAC, and connection replay guards for secure channel injection.\n- Introduced ConnectionLimiter, TokenBucketLimiter, and PolicyRateLimiter for adaptive throttling.\n- Enhanced protocol subsystem for lifecycle, metrics, and public RPC methods.\n- Added Timing subsystem with high-resolution TimingWheel and TimeSynchronizer.\n- Implemented middleware pipeline supporting inbound/outbound interceptors.\n- Major refactors for performance, stability, and maintainability across all layers.",
